  "geometry_derivation": {
    "conditions": [
      "Actual GLB mesh node26 has identity rest/current local transform; all3029 vertices have positive finite skin weights;26joint slots are in range; no morph targets; positive static scale.",
      "Parser bind preprocessing is included before runtime skinning: normalized weighted sum of jointRestGlobal*inverseBind*p_raw. Measured identity residual3.667666166884409e-7 and max point displacement5.90578761982163e-8m; raw positions are not claimed to be exact runtime bind vertices.",
      "Idle uses49 synchronized LINEAR samples from0to4seconds,48intervals. Rotation bound follows the complete shortest quaternion arc; translation follows the entire linear segment. No intermediate-pose sampling or observed-difference box chooses the envelope.",
      "Render rig computes delta=currentJointGlobal*inverse(restJointGlobal) for this identity mesh node. Positive four-weight sums are normalized by their total, matching skin_position."
    ],
    "recurrence": "First compute the parser-baked bind position using normalized positive skin weights and jointRestGlobal*inverseBind. For each vertex/joint interval, initialize R=norm(restJointInverse*p_bind), E=0; walk joint-to-root with E_parent=s_max*(E_child+2*sin(theta/2)*R_child)+norm(t1-t0), R_parent=s_max*R_child+max(norm(t0),norm(t1)). Normalize positive runtime skin weights and sum reference positions/errors. Expand each interval start reference by +/-E in each coordinate; union all48 interval boxes.",
    "projection": "Apply exact logged rigid model columns. Derive forward/right/up from actual manifest yaw/pitch and ordinary source camera basis. Use manifest60degree vertical FOV at drawable1280x720; aspect>=480/272 retains vertical FOV. All8 box corners have positive depth. Project corner extrema and floor/ceil outward to [1012,263,1260,411]exclusive.",
    "precision_limit": "The audit computes float64 interval bounds from stored float32 attributes and logged transform decimals. It is not a bitwise reproduction of Rust float32 skinning. Every changed-pixel box is at least16pixels inside this independently derived envelope, so border numerical precision does not change any observed classification.",
    "footprint_pixels": 36704,
    "exact_outside_pixels_per_comparison": 884896,
    "post_limit": "This is the geometric idle footprint, not a universal all-clips/effects/shadow convolution bound. Actual fullRGBA comparisons establish zero differences outside it for these10captured pairs."
  },
